    "answer": {
      "short": "When multiplying the same base numbers, we add the powers.\n\n$e^{7}$",
      "worked": "Add the exponents when multiplying powers with the same base. $$\\begin{align*}e^4\\times e^3 &= e^{4+3} \\\\ &=e^7\\end{align*}$$",
